  "name": "Cacophonic Shield",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Thunderous reverberations fill a 10-ft Emanation around you. Whenever it enters a creature's space, or a creature enters it or ends its turn there, that creature makes a CON save: 3d6 Thunder damage and Deafened until the start of your next turn on a failure, half damage only on a success (once per turn; your allies are unaffected). You have Resistance to Thunder damage and ranged attack rolls against you have Disadvantage. +1d6 per slot level above 3.</p>",
